komorebi-border-colours.patch, for KDE Rounded Corners 0.11.0
(https://github.com/matinlotfali/KDE-Rounded-Corners), applied by
nix/kde-rounded-corners.nix. It gives each window's outer outline the color
komorebi sets for it over D-Bus (org.komorebi.BorderColours1 at
/org/komorebi/BorderColours, on KWin's name org.kde.KWin); a window without one
is drawn with the colors of the settings. It also redirects a window drawn
through the effect again when the window's opacity changes, so that a change
of opacity alone shows.

